---
import ContentPageLayout from '../../layouts/ContentPageLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import FeatureItem from '../../components/FeatureItem.astro';
---

<ContentPageLayout
  title="Productivity Suite"
  description="Open-source productivity stack: wiki, issue tracker, Git hosting, and collaboration tools. An open-source alternative to Atlassian's suite."
  heroTitle='Productivity <span class="highlight">Suite</span>'
  heroSubtitle="Open-source productivity stack for secure collaboration"
  ctaTitle="Ready to Deploy the Productivity Suite?"
  ctaDescription="Request bundle specifications or discuss your use case with our team."
  ctaPrimaryButton={{ text: 'Request Bundle Spec', href: '/contact' }}
  ctaSecondaryButton={{ text: 'View All Bundles', href: '/bundles' }}
>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="content-text">
          <h2>Open-Source Productivity Stack</h2>
          <p>The Productivity Suite is an open-source alternative to Atlassian's suite, providing wiki, issue tracker, Git hosting, and collaboration tools.</p>
          <p>All tools are pre-configured, integrated, and ready for deployment. Perfect for organizations that need secure, self-hosted productivity tools.</p>
          <h3>What's Included</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Wiki</strong> - Documentation and knowledge management</li>
            <li><strong>Issue Tracker</strong> - Project management and task tracking</li>
            <li><strong>Git Hosting</strong> - Source code repository hosting</li>
            <li><strong>Chat/Collaboration</strong> - Team communication and collaboration</li>
            <li><strong>CI/CD Integration</strong> - Continuous integration and deployment</li>
            <li><strong>Documentation</strong> - Comprehensive setup and usage guides</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="content-text">
          <h2>Benefits</h2>
          <p>The Productivity Suite offers several advantages:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Self-Hosted</strong> - Complete control over your data and infrastructure</li>
            <li><strong>Open-Source</strong> - No vendor lock-in, full customization capability</li>
            <li><strong>Secure</strong> - Deploy in air-gapped or isolated environments</li>
            <li><strong>Cost-Effective</strong> - No per-user licensing fees</li>
            <li><strong>Integrated</strong> - All tools work together seamlessly</li>
            <li><strong>Compliant</strong> - Meet data residency and security requirements</li>
          </ul>
          <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">Who It's For</h3>
          <p>Organizations that need secure, self-hosted productivity tools. Perfect for government, defense, and organizations with strict data residency requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-image-section overlay-full">
    <img src="/images/site/productivity-suite-bg.jpg" alt="" class="bg-image" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="bg-image-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container" style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
      <SectionHeader title="Bundle Components" />
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <FeatureItem
          title="Wiki Platform"
          description="Comprehensive wiki for documentation, knowledge management, and team collaboration."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Issue Tracker"
          description="Project management and task tracking with workflows, boards, and reporting."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Git Repository Hosting"
          description="Self-hosted Git repository hosting with access controls and collaboration features."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Team Chat"
          description="Secure team communication and collaboration platform."
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentPageLayout>
